WEBVTT

NOTE
Diablos - Dark Messenger. Gravity demon summon.
Observed duration in reference video: ~37 seconds.
The gravity orb buildup is the longest phase; impact lands late.

00:00.000 --> 00:02.500
Diablos. Dark Messenger.

00:02.500 --> 00:08.000
The sky goes black. A purple void opens above the battlefield.

00:08.000 --> 00:14.000
Diablos descends — a black-winged demon with red eyes and curved horns.

00:14.000 --> 00:20.000
He hovers, spreads his wings wide, and stretches one clawed hand downward.

00:20.000 --> 00:28.000
A dense black orb of compressed gravity gathers in his palm, growing huge.

00:28.000 --> 00:33.000
Diablos hurls the void downward; it collapses on the enemies in a crushing implosion.

00:33.000 --> 00:38.000
The dark settles. Diablos folds his wings and is swallowed by the void.
